   <text>
      <body>
         
         <opener><dateline><date when="1916-11-21">November 21, 1916</date></dateline>
             John Gould Fletcher, Esq.  
               
               <placeName key="england">37 Crystal Palace Park Road 
               
               Sydenham, England</placeName></opener>
         
         <p>
            <persName key="ws_braithwaite">Braithwaite</persName> most anxious for your review of me. 
            No matter if printed in <title key="egoist">“Egoist”</title> too. “Egoist” not copyrighted here and no 
            circulation in <placeName key="usa">America</placeName>. Send soon as possible. 
            Congratulations on <persName key="harriet_monroe">Harriet’s</persName> prize, and thanks for article and letter. 
         </p>
         <closer>AMY LOWELL</closer>
      </body>
